  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This morning I noticed that there was an instance I could not join, I was receiving the \"you are not allowed to travel to that location\" error.\n\nMy kneejerk reaction was to assume that I was banned from the group for some reason, but upon further investigation I found that I am still in the group so that was especially strange.\n\nAs it turns out, the instance does not appear in the Group Activity feed, it only appears in the friends wing.\n\nI then decided to test with my own group by creating a role-locked instance and asking a normal member if they can see it, and sure enough, same scenario - not appearing in the Group Activity feed, but they can see where I am in the friends list, just unable to join it.\n\nSo yeah, role-locked group instance visibility is currently broken and needs a bugfix. In the meantime group members may see role-locked instances that they're not supposed to.\n\nThanks.",
